# Docs Sync (Conditional)

## When
- Setup, architecture, public behavior, or developer workflow changes.
- New commands/rules/processes are introduced.

## Do
- Update impacted docs in `README` and/or `docs/`.
- Keep planning artifacts in `docs/superpowers` for larger changes.
- Note follow-up doc debt if full update is out of scope.

## Avoid
- Leaving workflow-affecting changes undocumented.
- Mixing unrelated documentation rewrites.

## Done when
- Required docs are updated or explicit follow-up is captured.
